### ============================================================================
### BANK API REST CLIENT TEST FILE (VS Code / Antigravity REST Client Extension)
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. REGISTRASI USER BUDI (Mendapatkan Akun ACC-001 dengan Saldo 1.000.000)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name registerBudi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi",
  "password": "password123",
  "initial_balance": 1000000
}

### Simpan Token Budi dari Response Registrasi
@tokenBudi = {{registerBudi.response.body.token}}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. REGISTRASI USER SITI (Mendapatkan Akun ACC-002 dengan Saldo 500.000)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name registerSiti
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "siti",
  "password": "password456",
  "initial_balance": 500000
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. TEST LOGIN BUDI (PASSWORD BENAR)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginBudi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. TEST LOGIN BUDI (PASSWORD SALAH - HARUS ERROR 401)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. TEST AKSES AKUN BUDI TANPA TOKEN (HARUS ERROR 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/get?id=ACC-001


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. CEK DATA REKENING BUDI (ACC-001) - MENGGUNAKAN BEARER TOKEN
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/get?id=ACC-001
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. TRANSFER SALDO RP 350.000 DARI BUDI (ACC-001) KE SITI (ACC-002)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_account_id": "ACC-001",
  "to_account_id": "ACC-002",
  "amount": 350000
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. CEK SALDO AKHIR SITI (ACC-002) SETELAH DITRANSFER (HARUS BEKERJA)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/get?id=ACC-002
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
